WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.008 --> 00:00:03.930
[Elevator music playing]

00:00:03.955 --> 00:00:05.461
[Mobius sighs]

00:00:06.055 --> 00:00:08.199
MOBIUS
I'm Agent Mobius, by the way.

00:00:11.388 --> 00:00:13.044
LOKI
Are you taking me somewhere to kill me?

00:00:13.044 --> 00:00:15.130
MOBIUS
No. That's where you just were.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.919
I'm taking you
someplace to talk.

00:00:17.365 --> 00:00:18.708
LOKI
Well, I don't like to talk.

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:19.865
MOBIUS
But you do like to lie,

00:00:19.865 --> 00:00:21.474
which you just did.

00:00:21.474 --> 00:00:24.753
Because we both know,
you love to talk.

00:00:24.753 --> 00:00:26.551
Talky, talky.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.152
LOKI
How long have you been here?

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.027
MOBIUS
I don't know, it's hard to say.

00:00:31.027 --> 00:00:33.525
You know, time passes
differently here in the TVA.

00:00:34.488 --> 00:00:35.574
LOKI
What does that mean?

00:00:35.574 --> 00:00:37.174
MOBIUS
You'll catch up.

00:00:38.524 --> 00:00:40.032
LOKI
So you're part of the TVA's

00:00:40.032 --> 00:00:42.243
courageous and
dedicated workforce?

00:00:42.243 --> 00:00:43.048
MOBIUS
Yes.

00:00:43.048 --> 00:00:45.134
LOKI
You were created by the Time-Keepers...

00:00:45.134 --> 00:00:45.844
MOBIUS
Yep.

00:00:45.844 --> 00:00:48.063
LOKI
...to protect the sacred timeline?

00:00:48.063 --> 00:00:49.060
MOBIUS
Correct.

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:50.755
[Loki laughs]

00:00:51.201 --> 00:00:52.667
MOBIUS
Is that funny?

00:00:53.193 --> 00:00:54.622
LOKI
The idea that your little club

00:00:54.622 --> 00:00:57.414
decides the fate of trillions
of people across all of existence

00:00:57.414 --> 00:01:00.414
at the behest
of three... Space lizards?

00:01:00.414 --> 00:01:03.296
Yes, it's funny.
It's absurd.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.961
MOBIUS
I thought you didn't like to talk?

00:01:04.961 --> 00:01:06.132
[Loki scoffs]

